cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "cubebuild: construction pipeline for the Solid Earth Data Cube (SEDC) v1.0"
abstract: >-
  Construction pipeline for the Solid Earth Data Cube (SEDC) v1.0. It consumes
  a declarative layer contract and builds a tiered Zarr v3 store, the vector
  sidecars, a machine-readable manifest and structural validation reports.
  This is the software; the cube data are released separately.
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
